            "title": "How do I know if my order is confirmed?",
            "text": "<p>Once your order is successfully placed, you will receive an order confirmation email at the email address provided during checkout. If you do not see it within a few minutes, please check your spam or promotions folder. If you still haven’t received it, feel free to contact our support team at <a><strong>store.us@yosukata.com</strong></a>, and we’ll be happy to assist you.</p>"
