            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can I change my shipping address after my order is placed?",
            "text": "<p>If your order has not been processed or shipped yet, we may be able to update your shipping address. Please contact us as soon as possible at <a><strong>store.us@yosukata.com</strong></a> with your order number and the correct address. Once an order has been shipped, we are usually unable to make changes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item-3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Do you ship internationally?",
            "text": "<p>At this time, we primarily ship within the United States. If you are located outside the U.S. and would like to place an order, please contact us at <a><strong>store.us@yosukata.com</strong></a>, and we will do our best to assist you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item-4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How long will it take until I receive my order?",
            "text": "<p>Orders are typically processed within <strong>1–2 business days</strong>. Once shipped, delivery usually takes <strong>3–7 business days</strong> within the United States, depending on your location. You will receive a tracking number as soon as your order has been shipped.</p>"
          }
